Z||000007||Cooter||10-10-2001||11:55 AM||||I have the dash from Mom's '87 Cavalier. It is a factory rebuilt one (twice). Make an offer- it is at my brother's house, so it is technically his now. It was working when the car was totaled in a rear end collision a few years ago. I would not want to do it, but since you know the risks, go for it.||||reg||1
